.SS CVE\-2026\-81963
Microsoft Windows, added 2026\-09\-08.
.PP
Microsoft Windows Link Following Vulnerability.
.PP
\fIHow it is exploited (CISA):\fR
Microsoft Windows Update Stack contains a link following vulnerability that allows a local attacker to escalate privileges locally up to SYSTEM.
.PP
\fIRemediation:\fR
Apply vendor mitigations; follow CISA BOD 26\-04 (risk\-based patching) and forensics triage. Discontinue use if no mitigation exists.
 Due 2026\-09\-22.
.PP
